==================================================================
FRONT-END INITIALIZATION DIRECTIVE: CONFIGURATION & TOKEN SYSTEM
==================================================================

Jnr, execute the deployment of our official multi-metal High Finance token dictionary into the local workspace layout.

1. TARGET FILE MODIFICATION:
   - Path: "tailwind.config.js"
   - Action: Completely overwrite the file with the finalized configuration block to inject the 'rhythm' color spectrum and monospaced font family arrays.

2. TAILWIND CONFIGURATION CODE BLOCK:
/** @type {import('tailwindcss').Config} */
module.exports = {
  content: [
    "./src/pages/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx,mdx}",
    "./src/components/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx,mdx}",
    "./src/app/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx,mdx}",
  ],
  theme: {
    extend: {
      colors: {
        rhythm: {
          'obsidian-deep': '#0A0C10',
          'charcoal-matte': '#12161F',
          'glass-specular': '#1E2530',
          'goldenrod-core': '#DAA520',
          'gold-liquid': '#C5A059',
          'silver-mist': '#94A3B8',
          'sage-metallic': '#7A8A80',
          'slate-reflection': '#334155',
          'maroon-depth': '#2D1A1E',
        },
      },
      fontFamily: {
        mono: ['JetBrains Mono', 'Roboto Mono', 'ui-monospace', 'SFMono-Regular', 'Menlo', 'Monaco', 'Consolas', 'monospace'],
      },
    },
  },
  plugins: [],
};

3. VERIFICATION CYCLE:
   - Run a clean state local compilation check to verify the new color mappings parse without syntax errors.
   - Output a flat confirmation here once the file is fully written to disk and verified clean.

